Other chips: use_hold_reg / volt_switch (bits 29:28) exist from the Hi3518E V20X on (Hi3516C V300, Hi3516A V300, Hi3516A V200, Hi3519: reset 0x20000000); the Hi3516C/Hi3518 V100, Hi3516 V100 and Hi3516A/D V100 data sheets call them reserved (register reset 0); the boot bits 27:24 are additionally reserved on Hi3511/Hi3515/Hi3520 V100.

